      <section class="aqua-crete-section">
        <div class="aqua-crete-section__head">
          <h2>Aqua-Crete Concept</h2>
          <p>
            Aqua-Crete combines a 100% inorganic, non-combustible ceramic binder
            powder with a water-based liquid so it can be applied directly to a
            saturated concrete base (100% moisture) and opened to foot traffic
            in about an hour. Strong adhesion, high compressive strength, and a
            GORE-TEX®-style breathable waterproof function protect the
            substrate, while the odor-free, non-toxic formulation cures
            ultra-fast as an eco-friendly inorganic ceramic waterproof topping.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="aqua-crete-figure">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/images/aqua-crete-layer.jpg"
              alt="Cross-section showing Aqua-Crete layers from concrete base to polished top"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <figcaption>Layer structure from concrete substrate to polished
              finish</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="aqua-crete-highlight">
          <div>
            <h3>Layer Structure</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Polishing &amp; sealer application</strong>
                – Glassy coating that suppresses bacterial growth and blocks
                contaminant penetration.</li>
              <li><strong>Water-based inorganic Aqua-Crete</strong>
                – Ceramic mortar layer that includes channels for moisture
                discharge.</li>
              <li><strong>Moisture-conditioned substrate</strong>
                – Allows vapor diffusion while blocking reverse moisture.</li>
              <li><strong>Cement laitance &amp; plain concrete</strong>
                – Crack filler and primer strengthen the bond to the base slab.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Application Benefits</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Non-combustible inorganic makeup minimizes fire risk and pairs
                well with high-temperature sterilization.</li>
              <li>Low dust and particulates support food/pharma HACCP hygiene
                standards.</li>
              <li>Strong bond to the substrate prevents lifting or delamination
                over long service periods.</li>
              <li>High-gloss polish after finishing shortens cleaning and
                hygiene inspection time.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

